### Inventory Service First Slice — VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client fixtures
### Plan §4 권한 매트릭스 + §6 inventory spec 의 8개 시나리오를 즉시 실행 가능한 형태로 정리.
###
### 사용법:
###   1) docker-compose up (api-gateway / auth-service / user-service / inventory-service / postgres / eureka)
###   2) 아래 @masterToken / @managerToken / @warehouseToken / @salesToken 변수를
###      auth-service /auth/login 응답의 JWT 로 채워 넣는다.
###   3) ### 블록을 위에서 아래로 순서대로 실행. 시나리오 3 의 productId 가 4~6 에서 재사용됨.
###
### 토큰 발급 예시:
###   POST {{host}}/auth/login  body={"loginId":"manager01","password":"..."}
###   → response.token 을 @managerToken 에 복사.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@masterToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@managerToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@warehouseToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@salesToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]

### V2__seed_inventory_warehouses.sql 의 deterministic UUID (Plan §3.1 4-tier).
###   HQ-001 본사창고      (HEADQUARTERS) — 본사 보유 메인 창고
###   VH-001 1호차 차량재고 (VEHICLE)      — 출장 차량 이동 재고
###   CS-001 거래처 위탁창고 (CONSIGNMENT)  — 거래처 위탁 (소유권 자사)
###   VR-001 가상창고      (VIRTUAL)      — 삼성 직배/서비스 인보이스 (IN_TRANSIT 스킵)
@hqWarehouseId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000001
@vehicleWarehouseId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000002
@consignmentWarehouseId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000003
@virtualWarehouseId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000004

### 테스트용 product UUID — product-service 가 발급한 실제 UUID 로 교체.
@testProductId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000003001

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 1: 창고 목록 조회 (SALES 가능 — 인증된 모든 역할)
### 기대: 200 + 시드 4개 창고 (HQ-001/VH-001/CS-001/VR-001) 포함
###############################################################################
GET {{host}}/inventory/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 2: 신규 창고 등록 (MANAGER) — Plan §4: 창고 등록은 MASTER/MANAGER/DEVELOPER
### 기대: 201 + body $.data.id, code echo
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/inventory/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "VH-002",
  "name": "2호차 차량재고",
  "type": "VEHICLE",
  "address": null,
  "displayOrder": 21,
  "description": "추가 차량재고"
}

> {%
client.global.set("createdWarehouseId", response.body.data.id);
%}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 3: 입고 (WAREHOUSE) — POST /inventory/lots/inbound, 201 Created
### 기대: 201 + 신규 lot, StockBalance.totalQty += 100
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/inventory/lots/inbound
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{testProductId}}",
  "warehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "lotNo": "LOT-2026-05-001",
  "quantity": 100,
  "unitCost": 100000,
  "note": "초도 입고"
}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 4: 출고 — FIFO (WAREHOUSE), POST /inventory/deduct, 200
### 기대: 200 + 가장 오래된 lot 부터 30 차감, balance 70
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/inventory/deduct
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{testProductId}}",
  "warehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "quantity": 30,
  "fromReservation": false,
  "referenceType": "DEMO",
  "note": "FIFO 출고 시연"
}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 5: 예약 → 해제 (WAREHOUSE)
### 5-a) 예약 20개 → available 70-20=50, reserved 20
### 5-b) 해제 20개 → available 70, reserved 0
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/inventory/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{testProductId}}",
  "warehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "quantity": 20,
  "referenceType": "ORDER",
  "note": "예약 시연"
}

###
POST {{host}}/inventory/release
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{testProductId}}",
  "warehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "quantity": 20,
  "referenceType": "ORDER",
  "note": "예약 해제 시연"
}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 6: 재고 조정 (INVENTORY) — 실사 차이 보정. POST /inventory/adjust
### Plan §4: adjust 는 MASTER/MANAGER/INVENTORY 만. quantityDelta 는 부호 있는 정수.
### 기대: 200 + total 70-5=65 (음수 delta)
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/inventory/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{testProductId}}",
  "warehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "quantityDelta": -5,
  "reason": "월말 실사 결과 70 → 65 보정"
}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 7: 창고간 이동 — 전체 라이프사이클 (REQUESTED → APPROVED → SHIPPED → RECEIVED → CONFIRMED)
### 7-a) REQUESTED 생성 (WAREHOUSE) — POST /inventory/transfers, 201
### 7-b) APPROVED (MANAGER, WAREHOUSE 는 403) — POST /inventory/transfers/{id}/approve
### 7-c) SHIPPED (WAREHOUSE) — POST /inventory/transfers/{id}/ship
### 7-d) RECEIVED (WAREHOUSE) — POST /inventory/transfers/{id}/receive
### 7-e) CONFIRMED (MANAGER) — POST /inventory/transfers/{id}/confirm
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/inventory/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceWarehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "destinationWarehouseId": "{{vehicleWarehouseId}}",
  "reason": "REBALANCE",
  "reasonDetail": "차량 출고용 10개 이동",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "{{testProductId}}", "requestedQuantity": 10 }
  ]
}

> {%
client.global.set("transferId", response.body.data.id);
%}

###
POST {{host}}/inventory/transfers/{{transferId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/inventory/transfers/{{transferId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/inventory/transfers/{{transferId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
POST {{host}}/inventory/transfers/{{transferId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 8: 가상창고 출고지 → ship() 즉시 RECEIVED 점프 (Plan §3.1 IN_TRANSIT 스킵)
### VR-001 (VIRTUAL) 을 source 로 한 transfer 생성 → ship() 호출 시 status=RECEIVED 로 점프.
### Plan §3.1 의 가상창고 정의: 비물리이므로 IN_TRANSIT 단계 의미 없음.
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/inventory/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceWarehouseId": "{{virtualWarehouseId}}",
  "destinationWarehouseId": "{{hqWarehouseId}}",
  "reason": "SAMSUNG_DIRECT",
  "reasonDetail": "삼성 직배 — 가상창고 출고지",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "{{testProductId}}", "requestedQuantity": 5 }
  ]
}

> {%
client.global.set("virtualTransferId", response.body.data.id);
%}

###
POST {{host}}/inventory/transfers/{{virtualTransferId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### ship() 시 IN_TRANSIT 스킵 → 응답 $.data.status == "RECEIVED"
POST {{host}}/inventory/transfers/{{virtualTransferId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
